From 1b4ebcca6c376c6c4fe1cb33ebd344eaa869cd63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: add V2PeerProtocolHandler and sealedheader P2P relay

Add the 198-byte SealedHeader wire message (NetMsgType::SEALEDHEADER),
introduce V2PeerProtocolHandler with HandleSealedHeader and
MatchCandidateOverlay fast-path block reconstruction from the local
mempool overlay, and add unit tests in v2_protocol_handler_tests.cpp.
